    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1472\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/hmc.jpg\" alt=\"hmc\" width=\"371\" height=\"125\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>HMC, with offices in Brazil, Peru and Colombia - as well as home country Chile – is very well placed to service client needs throughout Latin America. </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">And, according to the CFI.co Judging Panel, ‘HMC does so with skill and aplomb. Their quest for asset efficiency is well rewarded through the efforts of a talented and highly experienced team of financial services professionals. We are very happy to announce the win of this sub region award in the name of HMC Capital Group.’</p>",
